  "bodyHash": "42540b814b502abb",
  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_6a468cb0-c00b-42a1-a1c9-08fe49b032ab.png\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">使用此资源包需要最新版本的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features (+v2.0.2)</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features (+v6.0.1)</a>&nbsp;。此为客户端模组，同时支持 Forge 和 Fabric。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/983/284/638491564386011875.png\" alt=\"EMF] 实体模型特性 [Fabric &amp; Forge] - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/master/.github/README-assets/icon.png\" alt=\"EMF] 实体模型特性 - 版本\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p>请务必使用正确的版本（针对动态眼睛和 Minecraft 版本）<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_d2ba8a4e-dcb6-4f00-a4a4-e66dce774182.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"309\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">OptiFine 暂不支持玩家自定义模型……仅供参考。</h3>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请查看 Laynce 制作的教程，了解新功能及 v3.0 新增的面部特性。</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uDccyv7FROs\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki/Fix-Black-Eyes\" rel=\"nofollow\">修复黑眼问题请遵循以下快速指南</a> &darr;。如需视频演示，请访问该资源包 Wiki 的此页面。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki/Fix-Black-Eyes\" rel=\"nofollow\">修复黑眼 &middot; IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves Wiki (github.com)</a></p>\n<p><strong>如果您希望第一人称视角下的手部停止摆动，<a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki/Fix-Moving-1st-Person-Hand\" rel=\"nofollow\">请前往 Wiki 此页面进行关闭。</a></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki/Fix-Moving-1st-Person-Hand\" rel=\"nofollow\">修复第一人称手部移动 &middot; IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves Wiki (github.com)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>为使此模组正常工作，您需在 EMF 和 ETF 设置中启用以下功能：</p>\n<p>首先打开资源包界面</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_f09491f0-124f-4f19-99e2-b96835d5f2b4.png\"></p>\n<p>点击此按钮（ETF 和 EMF 设置）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_c99a5eba-6b9c-40d8-9d32-72b8cfbd50ee.png\"></p>\n<p>点击“纹理”选项</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_424aa547-714d-45de-bbc8-46fa2745e7ce.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"165\"></p>\n<p>点击“玩家皮肤设置”</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_4ae87c2b-e52d-4dea-9e52-e3e0e97b084b.png\"></p>\n<p>并启用名为“允许皮肤透明度”的选项，将其设置为“所有皮肤”</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_7daaba8b-019b-4c03-a6eb-6a927f75dc6a.png\"></p>\n<p>返回模组设置，点击“模型”选项</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_aa349f89-7f7a-4ba8-a874-86f9c1bd52b7.png\"></p>\n<p>进入“选项与修复”</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_3e27492a-9389-4439-a342-02744d96f444.png\" width=\"314\" height=\"115\"></p>\n<p>最后将“阻止第一人称手部动画”选项设置为开启</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_17c589aa-b623-41b0-b934-e044549d22cd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如需实现眼睛动画，请前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Moves Wiki。</a> 简而言之，您必须在皮肤中添加额外的像素，并上传修改后的皮肤。<a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">这些额外像素的位置详见 Wiki</a>。所有支持的动画眼睛类型均在此列出。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/IthanMendoza/Fresh-Moves/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_011acb5a-47b3-4ff0-956b-52be4ae80541.png\" width=\"718\" height=\"535\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>以下是您最终在 skin.png 中必须达到的效果示例。此结果需直接作为您的皮肤使用。如果其他玩家的皮肤包含这些额外像素，您在多人游戏中即可看到他们的动态眼睛。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_40329591-41e0-4a5c-825a-3121c7bf2b9d.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"193\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_1b27f12a-82e7-425c-9a1c-d59532b153be.png\" width=\"635\" height=\"202\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_5a411bf2-1a3e-45a4-90d2-aa566e742393.png\" width=\"629\" height=\"258\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">看起来可能缺少部分眼白，但在游戏内眼白会扩展至正常大小。请注意眉毛位于第三个位置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>特性：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>本资源包彻底重做了待机、行走和游泳动画，并为玩家增加了更多细节。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_1ba6085d-60fb-457b-94a5-9643c17163cb.gif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_e68ba432-2c35-4d0e-8409-a9ea2313c0f5.gif\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>本资源包专为以下模组提供了特殊兼容性：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/parcool\" rel=\"nofollow\">Parcool</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paragliders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paraglider</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong> 的表情动作，<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/personality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Personality</a></strong>，<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amendments</a></strong> 以及 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/real-camera\" rel=\"nofollow\">Real Camera</a></strong> 模组。其他模组的动画也可能正常工作。本资源包完全不会覆盖手臂动画，因此手臂动画应能正常播放。腿部动画则不适用此规则。</li>\n<li>对于 Parcool，我们建议在配置菜单中禁用“快速奔跑”和“快速游泳”动画器（请使用“已配置”选项进入）：Animations/Animators。</li>\n<li>同时修复了<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sleep Tight</a></strong> 模组的睡眠姿势。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_521b6570-694f-40cf-afaf-87c8caab716d.gif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_6c9ab7fd-ac0d-441a-8adc-9d42ec91f342.gif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990406/description_d692db0f-a78b-4324-9d1e-ae634c1f6506.gif\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本资源包亦可于&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftras-fresh-player\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252ftras-fresh-player%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a></strong> 获取。</p>\n<p><strong>此处提供多种语言的教程：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f96cv9srgw7M%253fsi%253dhd9j0FbcUq4dQCee\" rel=\"nofollow\">西班牙语教程</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>致谢：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fresh__lx/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">FreshLX</a>：《Fresh Animations》资源包的创作者。本包中的劫掠者、末影人和村民动画均以此资源包为基础。</li>\n<li>Ithan：动画编辑者，负责广泛的眼睛支持及其他面部特性兼容。</li>\n<li>Traben：ETF 和 ETM 及自定义玩家模型特性的创作者。他在本包的制作过程中给予了大量帮助。</li>\n<li>BoZo-Xo2 &amp; CoolRanchChris：原版 Fresh Player Animations 资源包的创作者，以及 Traben Discord 服务器的成员（Fresh Moves 即基于此包开发）。</li>\n<li>TrasTick：维护 Modrinth 和 Planet Minecraft 页面。</li>\n<li>Laynce：Fresh Moves 视频教程的创作者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>您可以在 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/invite/rURmwrzUcz\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traben 的 Discord 服务器</a></strong> 的 <em>etf-emf-pack-list</em> 频道中找到 Fresh Player Animations 及其他玩家动画资源包。欢迎前往浏览。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
